  "description": "More trails. More power. More mountain. The new HAIBIKE ALLMTN CF 9.5 ABS is your upgrade for uncompromising all-mountain satisfaction. The ultra‑light carbon frame with integrated removable battery makes a sleek visual statement and offers sporty functionality. With RockShox suspension delivering 160mm travel at the front and 150mm at the rear, plus a mullet wheel setup, it strikes the perfect balance between composure and agility. The potent Bosch Performance Line CX motor drives you over every obstacle with vigour – complete with an 800Wh battery and Kiox 400 display, optimised for demanding terrain. On the downhill, the finely tuned Bosch ABS Pro paired with new two‑finger Shimano XT brake levers gives you maximum control – without sacrificing ride dynamics. In short: the ALLMTN CF 9.5 ABS isn’t just a new eBike – it’s a statement. For more performance, more trail fun and above all: more mountain.",
